number of ways to choose 2 red cubes out of 4 red cubes is C(4,2);
number of ways to choose 4 blue cubes out of 2 blue cubes is C(2,2);
number of ways to choose 3 green cubes out of 3 green cubes is C(3,3).
total number of way is $C_{4}^{2}C_{2}^{2}C_{3}^{3} = 3$ ways.

Therefore, the answer is $\boxed{3}$.
